    "updated_at": "2022-07-28T21:03:11Z",
    "body": "The wpt tests assume that using a blob after the original file has been removed will reject with NotFoundError; this isn't in the spec (and may not be always possible per above, and shouldn't be the case if my comment from June 15 is correct (that snapshot state implies the data is read or copied at creation time))",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
