    "created_at": "2022-07-28T21:56:39Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-07-28T21:56:39Z",
    "body": "Is this spec the right place for this discussion? I don't think anyone actually wants to create a copy of the file in `getFile()`. I agree with the sentiment that \"snapshot state\" is somewhat misleading phrase, but the terminology is from the File API.\r\n\r\nIt seems to me like the updating the File API spec to better specify when a file becomes unreadable would allow this spec to just point to that?",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
    "pin": null,
