    "created_at": "2022-08-02T22:58:38Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-08-02T22:58:38Z",
    "body": "> Also we don't want to spec something that requires stat() before every operation just to check if the 'snapshot state' has changed...\r\n\r\nI'm not a WebKit/Blink expert, but when I last checked their File API behavior they seemed to check the timestamp (which does require `stat()`) to detect the change. That's really unfortunate :(",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
